# Excludes non-website files from the Cloudflare Worker static-assets
# deploy. Without this, the build log showed .git internals, node_modules,
# and the Android/Node tooling getting uploaded and served alongside the
# actual site — wasteful and sloppy, though not a real security issue
# since this repo is already public.
.git
.gitignore
node_modules
android
www
scripts
resources
package.json
package-lock.json
capacitor.config.json
store-listing.md
LICENSE
README.md
